WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.534 --> 00:00:02.469
- [Gary] But I'm a truebred 
entrepreneur and by my

00:00:02.469 --> 00:00:05.052
definition that means
somebody who likes losing.

00:00:05.052 --> 00:00:08.242
Meaning I think of myself much
more as a UFC fighter than

00:00:08.242 --> 00:00:10.204
I think of as a boxer.

00:00:10.204 --> 00:00:13.213
I like boxing more even though
that's not a popular thing to

00:00:13.213 --> 00:00:17.985
say but I also think that in
boxing when you get a loss,

00:00:17.985 --> 00:00:19.887
it's like a
scarlet letter, right?

00:00:19.887 --> 00:00:20.854
You're like finished.

00:00:20.854 --> 00:00:22.456
In UFC, everybody has losses.

00:00:22.456 --> 00:00:23.888
That's just part of the game.

00:00:23.888 --> 00:00:27.661
And I associate to that
sport more as an entrepreneur.

00:00:27.661 --> 00:00:30.426
There is no great entrepreneur
that doesn't have losses.

00:00:30.426 --> 00:00:33.000
It's not even the cliche shit of
like you learn from your losses.

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:34.014
Fuck that.

00:00:34.014 --> 00:00:36.436
It's just that it meant
that you didn't take chances.

00:00:39.740 --> 00:00:42.342
I'm not here to be like
you learn from your losses.

00:00:42.342 --> 00:00:44.011
I'm here like, 
"Oh, you have no losses?

00:00:44.011 --> 00:00:46.280
"You didn't take any risk."

00:00:46.280 --> 00:00:47.514
Which means you're on defense or

00:00:47.514 --> 00:00:50.200
you're on passive mode, 
which is even scarier.

00:00:50.200 --> 00:00:51.652
You're in the middle.

00:00:51.652 --> 00:00:52.586
I almost wish you rather be

00:00:52.586 --> 00:00:56.205
defense than being stuck 
in the middle, so...

